            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RPKBP Heart Tip 11\" Door and Gate Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAcorn's RPKBP Heart Tip Black Iron pull handle is easily surface mounted to almost any door. Very nice large size (11\" high) door pull makes opening bigger doors easier. It is often used on gates, barn doors and garage doors. Its rough iron finish mimics that of naturally weathered iron. Plus, it's packaged with matching black iron finish mounting screws for easy installation.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/8-1-2-inch-shooting-heart-black-iron-door-pull-acorn-rpebp\">8-1/2 Inch Heart Door Pull</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Acorn RPKBP Heart Tip Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Weight: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Iron</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Finish Warranty!</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually. Package includes 1 pull and hardware for a surface mounted application.</i>\r\n</p>",
